       'coherence check' → 'Coherence Test'; 'transparency requirements' →
       'Structural Transparency'; 'honesty requirements' → 'Structural Honesty';
       'boundary controls' → 'Structural Containment'. Each canonical term
       carries structural enforcement meaning that paraphrases do not
